3. Comment: "@@@ elements in list decrease by 1"
   Assert statement: Debug.Assert(New_arrListCount >= Old_arrListCount - 1);

4. Comment: "@@@ the element's index is within the new list"
   Assert statement: Debug.Assert(Old_arrListIndexOfX >= 0 && Old_arrListIndexOfX < New_arrListCount);

